# Brivio Capital — redirect rules (Netlify)

# 1. Force HTTPS (non-www is canonical)
http://briviocapital.com/*        https://briviocapital.com/:splat  301!
http://www.briviocapital.com/*    https://briviocapital.com/:splat  301!

# 2. Strip www
https://www.briviocapital.com/*   https://briviocapital.com/:splat  301!

# 3. Prevent /index.html from being a distinct URL
/index.html                        /                                 301!

# 4. Clean URL for the unlisted pitch-deck page
/pitch                             /pitch.html                       200
